	;; char [offset size bearing advance], for 319 characters:
	;;   offset size - its part of the atlas (also usable with `add-image/part`);
	;;                 a size of 0x0 has no pixels (a space)
	;;   bearing     - where its top-left goes, from the pen at the line's top-left
	;;   advance     - how far the pen moves on
	;; A map, char to its block - looked up with `select/case`.
